# Ownership gate for content this repo publishes but does not own.
#
# GitHub CODEOWNERS can only name users and teams, never a repository, so this
# file cannot express "owned by czabriskie/bee-game" on its own. It exists to
# force a review on paths whose *facts* are decided elsewhere; the prose in
# AGENTS.md ("Content owned by other projects") is what records where each one
# actually comes from, and every such page carries a banner naming its source.
#
# Practical effect: a PR touching these paths requests Cam's review, which is
# the moment to ask "did the upstream project change, or is this drifting?"

# Legal and store-facing pages published on behalf of other projects.
/src/pages/rhythm-gardens/   @czabriskie

# This file and the ownership rules it points at.
/.github/CODEOWNERS          @czabriskie
